flowchart LR
    C[External sales channel<br/>Order capture and status display]
    G[Protected API boundary<br/>Authentication, authorization, request limits]
    I[Integration layer<br/>Validation, mapping, correlation, routing]
    Q[(Optional durable queue<br/>Async decoupling and retry)]
    S[SAP SD process boundary<br/>Supported sales-order API or approved interface]
    M[Monitoring and reconciliation<br/>Message state, exceptions, cross-system comparison]

    C -->|F1 Order request + channel reference| G
    G --> I
    I -->|Synchronous request when response needs permit| S
    I -.->|If async is selected and supported| Q
    Q -.-> S
    S -->|F2 Acceptance or rejection| I
    I -->|Correlated acknowledgement| C
    S -.->|F3 Status source TBD| I
    I -.->|Mapped status update| C
    G -.-> M
    I -.-> M
    Q -.-> M
    S -.-> M
